     Expected: corrections category atom surfaces first (trust_marker ✓)
     NOT: a narrative handoff with approximate similarity

  2. Ask Willow about a topic with both a governance spec and a narrative summary
     Expected: spec surfaces above narrative despite possible lower cosine similarity

  3. Observe trust_marker in injected context — ✓ means ratified, ~ means pipeline

