  Dependencies:
    - Embeddings live (confirmed: 17,507/17,507)
    - semantic-search endpoint responding (confirmed GET)
    - category and source_type fields present in response (confirmed)
  Fallback: SQLite path (query_willow_sqlite, query_shiva_sqlite) unchanged
  Corpus prerequisite: Sean should be satisfied corpus quality is sufficient
    before ratifying — this proposal propagates whatever is in the corpus
    at every prompt, above the 23³ self-propagating threshold.
